      "username": "Obinna_Ukwueze",
      "name": "Obinna",
      "created_at": "2025-07-09T21:21:58.656Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>FIRS (Federal Inland Revenue Service) has announced that its National e-Invoicing system (Merchant-Buyer model) will go live for all Large Taxpayers starting August 1st, 2025.</p>\n<p>Right now, ERPNext is not listed as one of the supported ERPs — which creates a big gap for Nigerian businesses using the platform.</p>\n<p><strong>Let’s Build the Integration</strong></p>\n<p>FIRS has released APIs for invoice validation, signing, and compliance. We can build an open-source ERPNext app to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Connect to the FIRS e-Invoicing API</li>\n<li>Submit and validate invoices</li>\n<li>Handle IRN and QR code generation</li>\n<li>Track invoice status and errors</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Call to Action</strong></p>\n<p>If you’re a developer, accountant, ERPNext user, or just interested in helping, please reply here. Let’s team up and make sure ERPNext is ready before the deadline.</p>\n<p>This is a great chance to support local businesses and grow ERPNext’s impact in Nigeria.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://einvoice.firs.gov.ng/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://einvoice.firs.gov.ng/favicon.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://einvoice.firs.gov.ng/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">einvoice.firs.gov.ng</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:120/100;\"><img src=\"https://einvoice.firs.gov.ng/favicon.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://einvoice.firs.gov.ng/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">FIRS Merchant Buyer Solution</a></h3>\n\n  <p>A simplified solution for merchants and buyers to manage transactions, track payments, and automate invoicing — all in one secure platform.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
